Cell["\<\
there is a constant circuit flow in PExA with 250 ml/s. That shifts the \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Exhale Airflow\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] but not the \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Inhale Airflow\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]! PExA output \
for \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Inhale Exhale Airflow [ml/s]\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] is misleading!  The shift is constantly 200 ml/s not \
250 ml/s.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.99399666701635*^9, 3.9939967033287296`*^9}, {
  3.9939969435532036`*^9, 3.993996987892956*^9}, {3.9940840157326527`*^9, 
  3.99408404144536*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"98b56e26-9e18-4942-8215-\
45aed996e113"],

